WEBVTT

00:00:29.442 --> 00:00:30.651
Having kids?

00:00:31.444 --> 00:00:35.156
You don't have to look far
to find fantastic exceptions

00:00:35.156 --> 00:00:36.783
to these rules,

00:00:36.824 --> 00:00:40.453
but we all share something
that makes us women.

00:00:41.454 --> 00:00:44.248
Maybe that something is in our brains.

00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:48.377
You might have heard theories
from last century

00:00:48.419 --> 00:00:51.255
about how men are better
at math than women

00:00:51.297 --> 00:00:52.840
because they have bigger brains.

00:00:53.591 --> 00:00:55.843
These theories have been debunked.

00:00:55.843 --> 00:00:58.763
The average man has a brain
about three times smaller

00:00:58.805 --> 00:01:00.556
than the average elephant,